### 0. 未登录测试1：GET 列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/projects

### 0. 未登录测试2：POST 创建
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "未登录创建"
}

### 1. 注册账号A（如果已存在可能会报错，忽略即可）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "userA",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 2. 登录账号A（IDEA 会自动记住这里返回的 Cookie）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "userA",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 3. 账号A 创建 A1
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "A1",
  "description": "A的项目1"
}

### 4. 账号A 创建 A2
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "A2",
  "description": "A的项目2"
}

### 5. 账号A 查询列表（验证倒序：A2 应该在 A1 前面）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/projects

### 6. 注册账号B
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "userB",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 7. 登录账号B（注意：这会覆盖掉账号A的 Cookie）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "userB",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 8. 账号B 查询列表（验证隔离：应该是空的 `[]`）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/projects

### 9. 账号B 创建 B1
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "B1",
  "description": "B的项目1"
}

### 10. 账号B 查询列表（只能看到 B1）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/projects

### 11. 重新登录账号A
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "userA",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 12. 账号A 查询列表（依然只有 A1, A2）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/projects

### 13. 参数校验：空名称
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "没名字"
}

### 14. 参数校验：全空格
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "   "
}

### 15. 参数校验：超长字段（101个字符）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA"
}

### 16. 伪造 ownerId 测试（传入 99999）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "伪造测试",
  "ownerId": 99999
}